  "notes": "THE ONLY ENTRY POINT. The chat-ID allowlist is the FIRST node after the trigger: anyone who finds the bot is rejected before a single row is written. Capture is verbatim and happens before interpretation, so a misclassification never loses what you actually said. Batch 1 uses a rule-based classifier; the Claude one lands in batch 4."
